  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Great location at East end of 30A Loop with walking/bicycling distance 1/2 mile from the beach. West Shore Place is a unique small neighborhood with a heated pool just north of famous Rosemary Beach and West of upscale 30Avenue shopping/dining. This Immaculate 3 bedroom 2 1/2 bath 2 story home invites you from a large front porch into a bright large living room area. The house has a modern well-stocked kitchen with breakfast bar and elegant dining area. On the second floor, a master bedroom with king bed has flatscreen TV, master bath and large deck. A cozy second bedroom has a queen bed and TV, while 3rd bedroom with two twin beds is decorated in bright joyful colors. A back patio has nature landscape atmosphere. Neighborhood private swimming pool is right across the street. Bicycling is a fun activity in that Area(20+ mile bike trails in the loop area). Various bike rental companies will deliver to the property.<br>Non-smokers only!<br>THIS HOUSE IS can be rented monthly at discount rate. GREAT FOR SNOWBIRDS .<br>Call, text or e-mail",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
